{"synopsis":"Jiang He, seorang gadis dari Dinasti Tang, melakukan perjalanan selama seribu tahun dan datang ke Xu Qing. Takdir menyebabkan cinta yang membentang seribu tahun.\n\nSegala sesuatu yang familiar dengan gadis itu telah menjadi sejarah. Remaja tanpa pamrih, memimpin seorang gadis untuk memulai hidup baru. Rasa sakit, kebingungan, sorak-sorai, dan tawa akan tetap ada di dunia baru ini. Suatu ketika, mereka terpisah ribuan tahun. Kini, mereka saling menjaga. Di dunia ini, cinta yang hanya dimiliki dua orang terukir.","alternative_title":"我家老婆来自一千年前, Wojia Laopo Laizi Yiqian Nian Qian, Wǒjiā Lǎopó Láizì Yīqiān Nián Qián, Vợ Tôi Từ Một Ngàn Năm Trước, Bà Xã Nhà Tôi Đến Từ Ngàn Năm Trước, Ma femme vient d'il y a 1000 ans","author":"Yuewen Manhua (阅文漫画), Flowers Haven't Bloomed (花还没开)","artist":"Painting Culture (之画文化)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5b21d6a6-21e2-491d-834c-8edf1ecca544","number":"456","chapter":"456","title":"Chapter 456","date":"2026-02-06","released":"2026-02-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ede0a1f3-4441-4939-9a83-3b22d1574ce3","number":"455","chapter":"455","title":"Chapter 455","date":"2026-02-06","released":"2026-02-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"cd447b8b-6968-4907-97d4-0e954a17c67f","number":"454","chapter":"454","title":"Chapter 454","date":"2026-02-06","released":"2026-02-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"01b9987c-a4b1-4201-a6f6-192fc276c113","number":"453","chapter":"453","title":"Chapter 453","date":"2026-02-06","released":"2026-02-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"018e1bb1-6056-4772-9fb0-103eacea5731","number":"452","chapter":"452","title":"Chapter 452","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"72da5c9a-af03-49ad-abac-9d512039d1e8","number":"451","chapter":"451","title":"Chapter 451","date":"2026-01-28","released":"2026-01-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f35d6ecc-8823-4956-bca8-db7cb78f23f2","number":"450","chapter":"450","title":"Chapter 450","date":"2026-01-14","released":"2026-01-14","images":[]},{"chapter_i